## 🚀 How to Use

### Starting a new analysis

1. Copy `templates/analysis_template.md` → `analyses/TICKER/analysis.md`
2. Copy `templates/model_template.xlsx` → `analyses/TICKER/model.xlsx`
3. Feed Claude the ticker and any available data — he'll research and fill what he can, flag the rest
4. Fill yellow cells in `model.xlsx` with sourced financials
5. Run through the write-up checklist

### Analysis workflow

| Step | What to do |
|---|---|
| 1. Financials | Pull from 10-K / 10-Q (SEC EDGAR) or earnings releases. Fill `Financials` tab |
| 2. Assumptions | Set DCF inputs in `Assumptions` tab (yellow cells) |
| 3. Valuation | Add comps in `Valuation` tab. Review DCF scenarios |
| 4. Write-up | Complete `analysis.md` — sections 1–8 |
| 5. Decision | Rate as BUY / WATCH / PASS with conviction level |

