## 🎯 Investment Criteria (Value + Reversal)

A stock earns a **BUY** rating when it satisfies most of the following:

- [ ] Trading below fair value on DCF and/or at discount to industry P/E
- [ ] Quality business: durable moat, positive FCF, reasonable debt
- [ ] Meaningful drawdown from highs (entry at value, not euphoria)
- [ ] Technical reversal signal: higher low, SMA reclaim, volume confirmation
- [ ] Clear catalysts within 3–12 months
- [ ] Asymmetric R/R: target upside >2x the downside to stop

